        Additionally, Youssef regularly keeps up with the latest trends and innovations in web development (Angular, JavaScript) and CI/CD (GitLab) through continuous learning.

        Thank you, Youssef!`,
        name: 'Alexandre DEPLAIX',
        job: 'Product Owner and Team Manager at Orange',
        image: {
          src: 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1du4LAuz7pPH7_i0Thj4Y6Er6BNfa0s3s',
          alt: 'Alexandre DEPLAIX Image',
        },
      },
